Create multiple species with variations in height, trunk diameter, branch structure, crown shape, foliage density, age, condition, and colour.

Tree placement should respond to terrain slope, elevation, soil, moisture, and biome.

Generate natural groupings, forest edges, clearings, mixed-density woodland, and isolated specimens.

